SUMMARY:AXIS BANK — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: AXIS BANK\n\nDeal context:\nAxis Bank is conducting investor calls
  for a potential US dollar-denominated dual-tranche offering comprising a 
 Perpetual Non-Call 5.5-year Additional Tier 1 (AT1) subordinated note and/
 or a 5-year Senior note. The deal is at the mandate/investor call stage\, 
 with calls scheduled for Monday\, 22 June 2026 across four small group slo
 ts in Hong Kong and UK time zones\, organized by logistics banks HSBC (Asi
 a) and JPM (EMEA). No pricing\, size\, or spread guidance has been provide
 d at this stage\; the issuer will be represented by CFO Puneet Sharma and 
 Group Head of Markets\, ALM & Syndication Rituparna Banerjee.
